<h1>Moments</h1>
<p>Keep the gifts and memories you share on each birthday, with a photo and a short note.
Every moment is between <strong>you</strong> and the other person.</p>
<img src="/assets/images/agemap/en/screenshot-moments.webp" alt="Moments Screen" class="app-screenshot">

<h2>Adding a Moment</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Tap a person on the AgeMap to open their details.</li>
  <li>Tap <strong>Moments</strong>, then tap <strong>+</strong> at the top right.</li>
  <li>Enter:
    <ul>
      <li>Direction — <strong>Given</strong> to them or <strong>Received</strong> from them</li>
      <li>Year</li>
      <li>Memo (optional)</li>
      <li>Photo or icon — 🎁 gift, 💰 cash, ❤️ heart, 🎂 cake, ❓ other</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ol>

<h2>Viewing Moments</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Moments are grouped by year, newest first.</li>
  <li>Each moment shows who and which way, such as <strong>"Given to Olivia"</strong> or <strong>"From Olivia"</strong>.</li>
  <li>Use <strong>All / Given / Received</strong> at the top to filter.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Moments with everyone</h2>
<p>Open <strong>your own</strong> details and tap <strong>Moments</strong> to see moments with everyone on one screen &mdash;
handy for checking what you gave to whom this year. New moments are added from each person's screen.</p>

<h2>Editing and Deleting</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Tap a moment to change its direction, year, memo, photo or icon.</li>
  <li>Tap the <strong>X</strong> at the top right of a moment to delete it.</li>
</ul>
